{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Blogの更新が遅くなってしまい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"申し訳ありませんでした；!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何回か記事を書いたのですが…"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は色々思うことが自分の中であって、どれも重くなってしまいまして；"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今更ずーんと暗くなっても"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結果は変わらないので。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"現実からいつまでも逃げるわけにはいかない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"MAXに重い記事は、新年の時に投稿済みなので敢えて、いつものBlogな感じで書かせて頂きます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回はこれが一番自分らしいBlogだと思うので更新します。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"桜井、選抜メンバーに入りましたっ!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よかったねー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これから、乃木坂46を代表して"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山パフォーマンスを披露する機会があるから、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「乃木坂ってサイコーにイケてるアイドルグループだっ☆!!」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"て一人でも多くの人に思ってもらえるように頑張るよ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の乃木どこ?終了直後から早速多くの方がコメントをくださって。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん……優しすぎだよ；；"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近本当に涙腺弱ってるんだからっ!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も撮影だったのに、みんなのせいで目腫れちゃって、腫れが引くまで大変だったんだよー!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、本当にありがとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんがいてくれるから、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また一から頑張ろうって思えるんだよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に幸せ者だね、玲香は。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"七福神落ちた事、落ち込んでると思いましたか??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちろん♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ガッツリ落ち込みました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ガッツリ泣きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"選抜入れたんだから、贅沢言うなよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って思われるかもしれないけれど、これが私の本音です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だって悔しいじゃん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"七福神入りたいじゃん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私のどこが駄目だったの?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何で私じゃ駄目だったの?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こう思うのって、普通でしょ?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"……あ゛ぁー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今の私、凄い嫌な奴だね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな風に思う自分は嫌いだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今、この文章を読んでくださってる皆さん、本当にごめんね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、今だけ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分のBlogでだけだから言わせてください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここでしか言わないから。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう、言わないから。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンの皆さんの期待に応えられなかった事が凄く悔しい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分の今の実力では、七福神が務まらないと判断された事も凄く悔しい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"番組で、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「最後にギリギリの滑り込みで入ることが出来た〜」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と言われた事がめちゃくちゃ悔しい!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分にとってベストな結果を出すことが出来なくて悔しい!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仲間に、戦友に越されたことが悔しい!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に悔しい!!悔しい!悔しい!悔しい!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、もうクヨクヨしないって新年迎えて決めたし!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゃんと新しいスタートきったんだよ!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"七福神を落ちた事で、今まで見えなくなっていた沢山の大切な事に気づくことが出来たんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回の七福神落ちは、自分が成長するためには必要な事だったんだと思うんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一生に一度の人生"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しいことばかりじゃなくて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"悔しいこと、辛いことも、同じくらい経験した方が面白いのよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とか言ってても"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回の結果はやっぱり悔しかったので(笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつか必ず、絶対!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"再び七福神を掴みに行きます!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の背中を押してくれる人が一人でもいる限り、私は絶対に夢を掴みに行くことが出来ると思うから。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"改めて…よろしくお願いします♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後に、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46、選抜、非選抜関係なく33人でお互いに支え合って頑張っていこうと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからの乃木坂46に期待していてください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"桜井玲香"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/01/09/120109_114558_3.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/01/09/120109_114640_3.jpg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}